OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and mostly dry start
OL,6,Ffor Orkney, but some blustery showery
OL,7,Frain over Shetland. Strong winds and
OL,8,Foutbreaks of locally heavy rain spread
OL,9,Fnortheast during the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FHeavy rain and gales for
OL,12,FOrkney at first, soon clearing
OL,13,Fnortheast, but persisting for Shetland
OL,14,Funtil shortly after midnight. Frequent
OL,15,Fshowers follow overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
