OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FFrequent showers for Shetland
OL,6,Fthrough the day, turning to more
OL,7,Fpersistent rain for Orkney in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Severe gales developing for
OL,9,FOrkney through the afternoon into the
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FFrequent showers clear and the wind
OL,14,Feases down Monday morning. Strong
OL,15,Fwinds, showery rain return from Monday
OL,16,Fnight and continue through Tuesday
OL,17,FWinds easing through Wednesday with
OL,18,Fsunshine and showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
